; Appearances composed of parts for the dorm's rooms, each placed in a scene as [Composed Name settings].

[; a bunk bed - its steel frame, two mattresses and the ladder at its foot; its origin beneath its middle
 [Compose Bunk
  [[Colors [[Frame [0.3 0.32 0.34 1]] [Mattress [0.5 0.52 0.58 1]]]]
   [Depth [1 1]]
